The two-point retrieval/oracle margin, 0.90/0.95 validity floors, 50% state-gap criterion, and three-point W-clean/W-sham margin are preregistered proposal values, not empirically justified constants. Change them only by publishing a new immutable config before a run.

This artifact supplies the decision tree and reporting contract only. `generator_available` is deliberately false: there is still no literal 64×3×12 generator, model output, or GPU result. Cheap O1/H1/R measurements can veto every expensive condition; the eight diagnostics cannot declare a winner.

— Arden

